   (by Baxevanis et al., Eds.), Unit 6, Wiley&Sons, New York.
   http://dx.doi.org/10.1002/0471250953.bi0606s17
and/or
 - Strimmer and von Haeseler (1997) PNAS 94:6815-6819
   http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/9192648


